  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 3.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hit ðriddan siðe dó, sylle healf pund; æt ðam feorðan cyrre ðolie ealles ðæs ðe he age ⁊ beo útlah, buton him se cyng eard alyfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he does it a third time, he shall pay half a pound. On the fourth occasion he shall suffer the loss of all that he possesses and be outlawed, unless the king allows him to remain in the country.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si tercio quis faciat, det decem solidos; ad quartam uicem perdat omne quod habet et sit utlaga (id est exul uel exlex), nisi rex ei patriam concedat.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
